  "title": "Pastitsio",
  "description": "Pastitsio, often called Greek lasagna, has layers of cinnamon-spiced beef, penne, and a rich béchamel topping for the most amazing baked pasta dish the whole family will enjoy!",
  "authors": [
    "ALKHATIB"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-10-18T00:57:33-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-01-20T17:21:11-05:00",
